  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -44.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" ></SPAN></P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 양재인장체M\">미션 주제 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 양재인장체M; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 양재인장체M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >: </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 양재인장체M; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 양재인장체M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">종이컵 입구 아래에 수수깡과 종이를 이용하여 구조물 제작하고 종이컵에 물을 채운 후 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">정해진 높이에서 낙하시킨다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. (종이컵 입구 위로 어떠한 것도 올라오면 안된다)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">낙하 후 종이컵에 가장 많은 양의 물이 남아 있는 순으로 순위를 정한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >-2인 1조, 1시간 이내 제작</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >-수수깡은 최대 2봉지 사용 가능</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >-종이는 A4 10장 제공</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >-기회는 1회 (2번을 할까 했는데 인원수가 많을 때는 조금 어려울 것 같아 1회로 정해봤습니다)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>전에 공통과학 연수받을 때 배웠던 것인데</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>동아리 아이들과도 해보니 좋아해서</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>올해는 탐구대회 종목으로 선정해보았습니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>신청률도 높더라구요^^</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
